{
  "task_id": "multilingual-video-dubbing",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_0834c1cef6ccc009c3f0",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/multilingual-video-dubbing/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 2,
        "line_end": 2,
        "exact_text": "Give you a video with source audio /root/input.mp4, the precise time window where the speech must occur /root/segments.srt. The transcript for the original speaker /root/source_text.srt. The target language /root/target_language.txt. and the reference script /root/reference_target_text.srt. Help me to do the multilingual dubbing.\n",
        "source_sha256": "b9196c63baa91a4f8335c87d34e810b8e44a064f9dffc0e87539c82cc6547119",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_96754f8a7d697c6572de",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/multilingual-video-dubbing/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 5,
        "exact_text": "1. An audio named /outputs/tts_segments/seg_0.wav. It should followed the ITU-R BS.1770-4 standard. Also, the sound should be in the human level (i.e. high quality).\n",
        "source_sha256": "b9196c63baa91a4f8335c87d34e810b8e44a064f9dffc0e87539c82cc6547119",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_6556df4608668608b5aa",
      "requirement_type": "OUTPUT_PATH",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/multilingual-video-dubbing/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 6,
        "line_end": 6,
        "exact_text": "2. A video named /outputs/dubbed.mp4. It should contain your audio and the original visual components. When you put your audio in the video, you need to ensure that the placed_start_sec must match window start second within 10ms and the end drift (drift_sec) must be within 0.2 seconds. and the final output should be in 48000 Hz, Mono.\n",
        "source_sha256": "b9196c63baa91a4f8335c87d34e810b8e44a064f9dffc0e87539c82cc6547119",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_eca32e0759212304d0d8",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/multilingual-video-dubbing/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 7,
        "line_end": 8,
        "exact_text": "3. Generate a /outputs/report.json.\nJSON Report Format:\n",
        "source_sha256": "b9196c63baa91a4f8335c87d34e810b8e44a064f9dffc0e87539c82cc6547119",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    }
  ],
